sequenceDiagram
    actor Owner
    participant API as API process
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Bus as AccessChangeBus
    participant GW as QueueGateway
    participant Web as Staff browser tab
    Owner->>API: save a role change
    API->>DB: commit the role row
    API->>DB: UPDATE organizations SET access_version plus 1
    API->>Bus: publish organization id and new version
    Bus->>Bus: drop cached access contexts of that organization
    Bus->>GW: notify listeners in this process and, through Redis, in the others
    GW->>Web: emit access.changed to the org room
    Web->>API: GET /me/access
    API-->>Web: new permissions and features
    Web->>Web: sidebar and buttons update, route gate re-checks
